# Merchant Dashboard – Analytics (UI-Only) – Cursor Rule

## Objective
Build an accessible, polished Analytics Dashboard at `/analytics` for merchants. UI-only: mocked data, no API calls. Provide KPIs, charts, shipment analytics, filters (date range), and export actions.

## Tech & Standards
- Framework: Next.js 14+ (App Router)
- Language: TypeScript
- Styling: Tailwind CSS only
- UI Components: shadcn/ui (Cards, Tabs, DropdownMenu, Select, Calendar/Date Range, Dialog, Skeleton, Badge)
- Charts: Recharts or Chart.js (mocked data; choose one – Recharts recommended)
- Forms: React Hook Form + Zod (filters/export)
- State: Local state (optional Zustand for persistence)
- Accessibility: ARIA, keyboard, WCAG contrast, reduced motion
- Premium Transitions: Fade/scale/opacity only; no translateY(-2px) on hover

## Route
- `/analytics` → Merchant Analytics Dashboard
- Navigation back: `router.push('/dashboard')` via back button with id `parcego-analytics-back-btn`

## Scope & Features
- KPIs (Cards)
  - Total Shipments, Delivered, Failed, On-time %, Avg Delivery Time
  - Revenue MTD/YTD, AOV
- Filters
  - Date range picker with presets (Last 7/30/90 days, MTD, YTD, Custom)
  - Optional filters: Service Type, Status, Region
  - Persist selected filters to `localStorage`
- Charts (mock)
  - Shipments Over Time (Area/Line)
  - Revenue Over Time (Area/Bar)
  - Status Distribution (Bar/Pie)
  - Service Type Mix (Donut)
- Tables & Insights (mock)
  - Top Routes/Lanes (origin → destination) by volume/revenue
  - Exceptions: delayed/failed shipments summary
- Export (mock)
  - Export CSV (timeseries + table)
  - Export PNG (chart snapshot – mocked)
  - Export PDF (report bundle – mocked)
  - Export confirmation `Dialog`
- Empty/Skeleton States
  - Skeleton on initial mount; empty state with helpful copy when no data in range
- Performance
  - Virtualized table not required; small mock sets
- No Shopify UI/logic

## Naming & IDs
- Prefix all IDs with `parcego-` and ensure global uniqueness
  - `parcego-analytics-back-btn`, `parcego-analytics-filters`, `parcego-analytics-export-menu`
  - `parcego-analytics-kpi-total-shipments`, etc.

## Accessibility
- Keyboard traversable filters and menus
- Labels for all inputs; `aria-live="polite"` for toast/alerts
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` → disable entrance animations

## Data & Validation (Zod)
- All data mocked; generate once per mount based on current filter range

Schemas:
```ts
import { z } from "zod";

export const DateRangeSchema = z.object({
  from: z.date(),
  to: z.date(),
});

export const FiltersSchema = z.object({
  range: DateRangeSchema,
  preset: z.enum(["last7", "last30", "last90", "mtd", "ytd", "custom"]),
  serviceType: z.enum(["all", "standard", "express", "overnight"]).default("all"),
  status: z.enum(["all", "pending", "in_transit", "delivered", "failed"]).default("all"),
  region: z.enum(["all", "na", "eu", "mea", "apac", "latam"]).default("all"),
});

export const TimeSeriesPointSchema = z.object({
  date: z.string(),        // ISO date
  shipments: z.number(),
  revenue: z.number(),     // USD
  delivered: z.number(),
  failed: z.number(),
});

export const KpiSchema = z.object({
  totalShipments: z.number(),
  delivered: z.number(),
  failed: z.number(),
  onTimePct: z.number(),        // 0..100
  avgDeliveryDays: z.number(),  // float
  revenueMTD: z.number(),
  revenueYTD: z.number(),
  aov: z.number(),
});

export const ExportRequestSchema = z.object({
  type: z.enum(["csv", "png", "pdf"]),
  includeCharts: z.boolean().default(true),
  includeTables: z.boolean().default(true),
  includeKpis: z.boolean().default(true),
});
```

## UI Components (shadcn/ui)
- Layout: `Card`, grid sections
- Filters: `Calendar` (date range), `Select`, `DropdownMenu` (presets)
- Actions: `Button`, `DropdownMenu` for Export, `Dialog` for confirm
- Feedback: `Alert`, `Skeleton`, optional `Badge` tags
- Tabs (optional): Overview | Shipments | Revenue

## Premium Transitions
- Page/container: fade-in + slight slide via opacity/transform only
- Hover states: subtle shadow/color; avoid translateY(-2px) on hover
- Reduced motion: disable animations

## State & Persistence
- Keep `FiltersSchema` in component state; serialize to `localStorage` under `parcego_analytics_filters`
- Recompute mocked dataset when filters change; keep CPU light

## Pseudocode – Implementation Plan
1. Header
   - Back button → `/dashboard`, title “Analytics”, short description
2. Filters Bar
   - Date range picker + presets dropdown
   - Selects: Service Type, Status, Region
   - “Apply” and “Reset” buttons; persist to localStorage
3. KPI Row
   - 6–8 cards with key metrics (ids per KPI)
4. Charts Grid
   - Shipments Over Time (Area), Revenue Over Time (Bar/Area)
   - Status Distribution (Pie/Bar), Service Mix (Donut)
5. Insights/Table
   - Top Routes table; Exceptions summary list
6. Export
   - Export button → dropdown (CSV, PNG, PDF) → confirmation dialog (mock)
   - Show `Alert` after “exported” (mock)
7. Skeleton/Empty
   - Show skeletons on mount; empty copy if no data in range
8. Accessibility & Reduced Motion
   - aria-* everywhere, keyboard-friendly, no gratuitous motion

## Example Skeleton – `/app/analytics/page.tsx` (UI-only)
```tsx
"use client";

import React, { useEffect, useMemo, useState } from "react";
import { useRouter } from "next/navigation";
import { z } from "zod";
import {
  Card, CardHeader, CardTitle, CardDescription, CardContent
} from "@/components/ui/card";
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";
import { Alert, AlertDescription, AlertTitle } from "@/components/ui/alert";
import { Select } from "@/components/ui/select";        // ensure present; or swap to native <select>
import { DropdownMenu, DropdownMenuTrigger, DropdownMenuContent, DropdownMenuItem } from "@/components/ui/dropdown-menu";
import { Skeleton } from "@/components/ui/skeleton";    // ensure present; if not, use placeholder divs
import { Label } from "@/components/ui/label";

const FiltersSchema = z.object({
  // match the rule schema (simplified here)
  preset: z.enum(["last7","last30","last90","mtd","ytd","custom"]).default("last30"),
  serviceType: z.enum(["all","standard","express","overnight"]).default("all"),
  status: z.enum(["all","pending","in_transit","delivered","failed"]).default("all"),
  region: z.enum(["all","na","eu","mea","apac","latam"]).default("all"),
});

export default function AnalyticsPage() {
  const router = useRouter();
  const prefersReducedMotion = typeof window !== "undefined" && window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches;

  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);
  const [exportMsg, setExportMsg] = useState<string | null>(null);
  const [filters, setFilters] = useState<z.infer<typeof FiltersSchema>>({
    preset: "last30",
    serviceType: "all",
    status: "all",
    region: "all",
  });

  useEffect(() => {
    try {
      const raw = localStorage.getItem("parcego_analytics_filters");
      if (raw) setFilters({ ...filters, ...JSON.parse(raw) });
    } catch {}
    const t = setTimeout(() => setLoading(false), 400);
    return () => clearTimeout(t);
  }, []); // eslint-disable-line

  useEffect(() => {
    try {
      localStorage.setItem("parcego_analytics_filters", JSON.stringify(filters));
    } catch {}
  }, [filters]);

  const handleBack = () => router.push("/dashboard");

  const handleExport = (type: "csv"|"png"|"pdf") => {
    setExportMsg(`Exported ${type.toUpperCase()} (mock)`);
    setTimeout(() => setExportMsg(null), 1500);
  };

  return (
    <div className="min-h-screen bg-gray-50">
      <div className="bg-white border-b shadow-sm">
        <div className="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
          <div className="flex h-16 items-center justify-between">
            <div className="flex items-center gap-3">
              <Button id="parcego-analytics-back-btn" variant="ghost" size="sm" onClick={handleBack} aria-label="Back to Dashboard">
                <span aria-hidden className="mr-2">←</span> Back to Dashboard
              </Button>
              <div className="h-6 border-l" />
              <div>
                <h1 className="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Analytics</h1>
                <p className="text-sm text-gray-500">Performance metrics, revenue charts, and shipment analytics.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <DropdownMenu>
              <DropdownMenuTrigger asChild>
                <Button id="parcego-analytics-export-menu" variant="outline">Export</Button>
              </DropdownMenuTrigger>
              <DropdownMenuContent align="end">
                <DropdownMenuItem onClick={() => handleExport("csv")}>Export CSV</DropdownMenuItem>
                <DropdownMenuItem onClick={() => handleExport("png")}>Export PNG</DropdownMenuItem>
                <DropdownMenuItem onClick={() => handleExport("pdf")}>Export PDF</DropdownMenuItem>
              </DropdownMenuContent>
            </DropdownMenu>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <main className={`mx-auto max-w-6xl p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8 ${prefersReducedMotion ? "" : "animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-1 duration-300"}`}>
        {exportMsg && (
          <Alert className="mb-4" role="status" aria-live="polite">
            <AlertTitle>Export</AlertTitle>
            <AlertDescription>{exportMsg}</AlertDescription>
          </Alert>
        )}

        {/* Filters Bar */}
        <Card id="parcego-analytics-filters" className="mb-4">
          <CardHeader>
            <CardTitle>Filters</CardTitle>
            <CardDescription>Adjust the date range and dimensions to analyze.</CardDescription>
          </CardHeader>
          <CardContent className="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 md:grid-cols-4">
            {/* Replace with shadcn Selects if present in your components */}
            <div>
              <Label htmlFor="preset">Preset</Label>
              <select id="preset" className="mt-1 w-full rounded-md border px-3 py-2 text-sm" value={filters.preset} onChange={(e) => setFilters({ ...filters, preset: e.target.value as any })}>
                <option value="last7">Last 7 days</option>
                <option value="last30">Last 30 days</option>
                <option value="last90">Last 90 days</option>
                <option value="mtd">MTD</option>
